  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Inclusive Disaster Risk Governance for Climate Resilience in Asia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will focus on building the resilience of communities, especially the most vulnerable groups to prepare and adapt to risks of disasters by strengthening disaster preparedness capacities and promoting inclusion in regional national, and local platforms to ensure that vulnerable populations are less vulnerable to social and economic consequences  of disasters and climate change in Asia.</narrative>
  </description>
